{"surah":101,"name":"سُورَةُ القَارِعَةِ","englishName":"Al-Qaari'a","englishNameTranslation":"The Calamity","numberOfAyahs":11,"revelationType":"Meccan","ayahs":[{"number":1,"arabic":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Al qaari'ah","banglaTransliteration":"আল কা-রি‘আহ ।","bangla":"করাঘাতকারী,","english":"The Striking Calamity -"},{"number":2,"arabic":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Mal qaariah","banglaTransliteration":"মাল কা-রি‘আহ।","bangla":"করাঘাতকারী কি?","english":"What is the Striking Calamity?"},{"number":3,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Wa maa adraaka mal qaari'ah","banglaTransliteration":"ওয়ামাআদরা-কা মাল কা-রি‘আহ।","bangla":"করাঘাতকারী সম্পর্কে আপনি কি জানেন ?","english":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?"},{"number":4,"arabic":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","transliteration":"Yauma ya koonun naasu kal farashil mabthooth","banglaTransliteration":"ইয়াওমা ইয়াকূনুন্না-ছুকাল ফারা-শিল মাবছূছ।","bangla":"যেদিন মানুষ হবে বিক্ষিপ্ত পতংগের মত","english":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,"},{"number":5,"arabic":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","transliteration":"Wa ta koonul jibalu kal 'ihnil manfoosh","banglaTransliteration":"ওয়া তাকূনুল জিবা-লুকাল‘ইহনিল মানফূশ।","bangla":"এবং পর্বতমালা হবে ধুনিত রঙ্গীন পশমের মত।","english":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up."},{"number":6,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","transliteration":"Fa-amma man thaqulat mawa zeenuh","banglaTransliteration":"ফাআম্মা-মান ছাকুলাত মাওয়া-ঝীনুহূ।","bangla":"অতএব যার পাল্লা ভারী হবে,","english":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],"},{"number":7,"arabic":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍۢ رَّاضِيَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Fahuwa fee 'ishatir raadiyah","banglaTransliteration":"ফাহুওয়া ফী ‘ঈশাতির রা-দিয়াহ।","bangla":"সে সুখীজীবন যাপন করবে।","english":"He will be in a pleasant life."},{"number":8,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","transliteration":"Wa amma man khaffat mawa zeenuh","banglaTransliteration":"ওয়া আম্মা-মান খাফফাত মাওয়াঝীনুহূ","bangla":"আর যার পাল্লা হালকা হবে,","english":"But as for one whose scales are light,"},{"number":9,"arabic":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Fa-ummuhu haawiyah","banglaTransliteration":"ফাউম্মুহূহা-বিইয়াহ।","bangla":"তার ঠিকানা হবে হাবিয়া।","english":"His refuge will be an abyss."},{"number":10,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","transliteration":"Wa maa adraaka maa hiyah","banglaTransliteration":"ওয়ামাআদরা-কা মা-হিয়াহ।","bangla":"আপনি জানেন তা কি?","english":"And what can make you know what that is?"},{"number":11,"arabic":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","transliteration":"Naarun hamiyah","banglaTransliteration":"না-রুন হা-মিয়াহ।","bangla":"প্রজ্জ্বলিত অগ্নি!","english":"It is a Fire, intensely hot."}]}